                      "summary": "Izaan summer camp",
                      "description": "Drop Off Time: 8:00 AM - 9:00 AM\nPick Up Time: 4:00 PM - 5:30 PM\n \nHere is the schedule for the Summer Camp:\n\nWeek 1: June 29 - July 3 (Short week) - No Camp Wednesday July 1\nWeek 2: July 6 - July 10\nWeek 3: July 13 - July 17\nWeek 4: July 20 - July 24\nWeek 5: July 27 - July 31\nWeek 6: Aug 4 - Aug 7 (Short week) - No Camp Monday August 3\nWeek 7: Aug 10 - Aug 14\nWeek 8: Aug 17 - Aug 21\nWeek 9: Aug 31 - Sept 4 (Redeemer Only)\n\nSwimming will be at Dalewood Recreation Centre\n\n\u200a\nWhat to bring\n\u2022 Lunch (nut-free)\n\u2022 Two Snacks (nut-free)\n\u2022 Reusable Water bottle\n\u2022 1 extra set of clothes, including socks and underwear\n\u2022 Swimsuit & Towel\n\u2022 Running shoes\n\u2022 Rain jacket (if light rain is in the forecast)\n\u2022 Backpack\n\u2022 Sunscreen\n\u2022 Hat",
                      "location": "Dalewood Elementary School, 1150 Main St W, Hamilton, ON L8S 1C2, Canada",
                      "uid": "70o6adj36dhm4bb46oojgb9kccq3ib9p70o32bb469h32dhp60r3co9l70@google.com",
