            "alias": "Turn On or Off the Basement Lights with the Basement Stair Lights",
            "conditions": [],
            "description": "Pressing the basement STAIR light switch toggles the basement ROOM lights. Fixed 2026-06-23: action targeted itself (switch.basement_stair_light_switch_1) causing an infinite on/off loop; now targets switch.basement_lights_switch_1. Fixed 2026-07-14: the trigger was a bare state trigger, so every localtuya WiFi drop/reconnect (unavailable transitions) and even attribute updates fired a TOGGLE \u2014 basement lights turned off/on intermittently by themselves. Now only real on<->off presses trigger.",
