            "description": "Waters the front lawn at 05:00 for the Smart Irrigation computed duration, then turns off and calls smart_irrigation.reset_bucket so the deficit resets. SI calculates at 04:00; this runs the valve at 05:00 when there is a positive duration AND the last watering was >=2 days ago (deep-and-infrequent watering, user 2026-07-13 \u2014 deficit accumulates across skipped days). Calibrated 2026-07-13: zone throughput 13.4 L/min (METER-MEASURED: 67 L in 5 min; was 25) and zone maximum_duration raised to 5400 s, so expect ~40-80 min runs every other day (~25 mm/week incl. rain credit). run_seconds capped at 5400 s; the valve_2 Max Runtime Failsafe (100 min) is the independent hard backstop. 2026-07-14: valve briefly moved to Tuya Cloud (its ZHA link was LQI 17, dropping ~half of all commands), then moved BACK to ZHA once the user relocated the network Zigbee coordinator (socket://192.168.0.42:6638) closer to the sprinkler. Measured after relocation: LQI 17 -> 100, command delivery 6/6 (100%), actuation confirmed in 2 s (vs 8 s via Tuya cloud). Front lawn = switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2 (outlet 1 unused, user-confirmed). Now fully LOCAL \u2014 no internet dependency for the 5 AM run \u2014 and the device's own status_2 / irrigation_duration_2 sensors are back for verifying a run actually delivered water.\n",
            "id": "lawn_watering_start",
            "mode": "single",
            "triggers": [
              {
                "trigger": "time",
                "at": "05:00:00"
              }
            ],
            "conditions": [
              {
                "condition": "numeric_state",
                "entity_id": "sensor.smart_irrigation_front_lawn_valve_2",
                "above": 0
              },
              {
                "condition": "state",
                "entity_id": "input_boolean.lawn_watering_master_enable",
                "state": "on"
              },
              {
                "condition": "template",
                "value_template": "{{ state_attr('automation.lawn_watering_start_cycle', 'last_triggered') is none\n   or (now() - state_attr('automation.lawn_watering_start_cycle', 'last_triggered')).total_seconds() >= 169200 }}"
              }
            ],
            "actions": [
              {
                "variables": {
                  "run_seconds": "{{ [ states('sensor.smart_irrigation_front_lawn_valve_2') | float(0) | round(0) | int, 5400 ] | min }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "repeat": {
                  "sequence": [
                    {
                      "action": "switch.turn_on",
                      "target": {
                        "entity_id": "switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2"
                      },
                      "continue_on_error": true
                    },
                    {
                      "wait_template": "{{ is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'on') }}",
                      "timeout": "00:00:45",
                      "continue_on_timeout": true
                    }
                  ],
                  "until": "{{ is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'on') or repeat.index >= 3 }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ not is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'on') }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                    "data": {
                      "title": "\ud83d\udea8 Lawn watering FAILED to start",
                      "message": "valve_2 never opened after 3 attempts (Zigbee link? LQI was {{ state_attr('sensor.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_battery','linkquality') | default('n/a') }}). Bucket NOT reset \u2014 the {{ (run_seconds / 60) | round(1) }} min deficit carries to the next run. Lawn was NOT watered."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "stop": "valve never opened - deficit preserved for next run"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "delay": {
                  "seconds": "{{ run_seconds }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "repeat": {
                  "sequence": [
                    {
                      "action": "switch.turn_off",
                      "target": {
                        "entity_id": "switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2"
                      },
                      "continue_on_error": true
                    },
                    {
                      "wait_template": "{{ is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'off') }}",
                      "timeout": "00:00:45",
                      "continue_on_timeout": true
                    }
                  ],
                  "until": "{{ is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'off') or repeat.index >= 4 }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ not is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'off') }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                    "data": {
                      "title": "\ud83d\udea8 Lawn valve did NOT close",
                      "message": "valve_2 still reports ON after 4 close attempts. The 100-min failsafe is the backstop \u2014 go check the tap."
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "smart_irrigation.reset_bucket",
                "target": {
                  "entity_id": "sensor.smart_irrigation_front_lawn_valve_2"
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                "data": {
                  "title": "\u2705 Front lawn watered",
                  "message": "Ran {{ run_seconds }} s ({{ (run_seconds / 60) | round(1) }} min), Smart Irrigation calc. Bucket reset."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
